0..75 Comment "//! `ZeroFiber` states an extension signature over the two points of `Two`."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..140 Comment "//! The signature fixes each `Val` cell to `zero` at `left`."
141..144 Comment "//!"
145..212 Comment "//! The checker applies its boundary, β and η laws by conversion."
